+
+| Family | Matches |
+|---|---|
+| `scratch-dir` | a path component is exactly `.scratch` |
+| `ext` | basename `*.out` or `*.log` |
+| `draft` | basename `*-draft.*` |
+| `checkpoint` | basename `*checkpoint*.json`, `*checkpoint*.png`, `*ckpt*.json`, `*ckpt*.png`, `*.ckpt`, `launch-*.json` |
